{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/kxjt60","slideIndex":6,"text":"This project adapts the selected paper's pipeline framing; it does not reproduce its harmful-content benchmark or invent a new moderation algorithm. Four lexical rules existed before the new cases and remained unchanged after observation. Code checks: evidence/code-test-output.txt. HTTP checks: evidence/api-test-output.txt. Reproducibility: README.md and Run-Experiments.ps1. Student independent labels remain blank in student-review.csv."}
